# Authored on Windows, built and served from Linux. Store and check out LF so
# core.autocrlf=true never shows line-ending-only changes as modifications.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
